Setup			fargo_dvd

### Disk parameters

AspectRatio     	0.05            Thickness over Radius in the disc
Sigma0			1.0e-4 		Surface Density at r=1 
SigmaSlope		0.5		Slope of the surface density
FlaringIndex		0.0		Flare of the disk
#Nu			1.0e-5		Uniform kinematic viscosity
ALPHA                   1.0e-3
DampingZone		2.0
Spacing                 Log
TauDamp                 10.0


### Dust parameters
### In cm; condinit deals with this already
RHOSOLID               2.4
PARTICLESIZE1          0.1
###PARTICLESIZE2          0.1
###PARTICLESIZE3          0.01


#Invstokes1		100.0   Inverse of the Stokes number for dust1
#Invstokes2		10.0    Inverse of the Stokes number for dust2
#Invstokes3		1000.0    Inverse of the Stokes number for dust3

Epsilon                 0.01    Dust-to-gas mass ratio

### Planet parameters

PlanetConfig		planets/nobin.cfg
ThicknessSmoothing 	0.1
Eccentricity		0.1
IndirectTerm		yes

### Mesh parameters

Nx			1		Number of azimuthal zones
Ny               	2048	Number of Radial zones

Xmin		       -3.14159265358979323844
Xmax			3.14159265358979323844

Ymin			0.3		Inner radius
Ymax			30.00		Outer radius

### Frame of reference

OmegaFrame     		0.0
Frame			F

### Output control parameters

DT                      0.06283185307179586476
#DT			0.314159265359	Time step length
Ninterm	 		1		Time steps between outputs
Ntot			25		Total number of time steps

OutputDir		/project/phys-k/fargo_share/fargo_gasdisk_alldamp_viscr_lowdamp_hihires_superfinedt_openinner
